sverse one in the inset. In both systems, $\gamma\hat\tau = 0.006$, $\alpha = 1$ and $\phi = 0.05$. For our system $\Delta/(\sigma \hat\tau)=0.046$. For Lei and Ni's model, $\Delta E/m(\sigma\hat\tau)^2 = 0.0125$  These choices of parameters lead to approximately the same temperature for both systems $T_0/m(\sigma\hat\tau)^2\simeq0.0158$. In all cases, $N$ varies between $5\times 10^4$ and $1.5\times 10^6$.}\label{fig:hydrodynamic}
