    ^2/\rho_0)} =&z^3-z^2 \left[-\gamma+G_T-\left(\frac{\kappa_0 }{n_0}+\frac{\eta_0^\parallel}{\rho_0 }\right)k^2\right]-z \left[\gamma G_T-\left(\frac{\gamma \kappa_0 }{n_0}-\frac{G_T \eta_0^\parallel}{\rho_0 }+\frac{p_0 p_T+\kappa_0\eta_0^\parallel k^2}{n_0 \rho_0 }+ p_\rho\right)k^2\right]+\\&\left[G_\rho p_T-G_T p_\rho+(\kappa_0 p_\rho - \mu_0 p_T)\frac{k^2}{n_0}\right]k^2.     
