\paragraph{FoldSeek Cluster Comparisons} We also evaluate the FID between pairs of FoldSeek clusters using our ProxCLR embeddings. We see in Fig.~\ref{fig:perturbations} that the FID between disjoint samples from the same cluster is much lower than between different clusters. We also find that the FID correlates (R=$0.80$) with optimal transport distances based on TM Scores (see \cite{faltings2025proteinfidimprovedevaluation} for details).

