Therefore, the force acting on the body when the iteration count is $\ell$ is estimated by
\begin{equation}
\bm{F}_{\ell}^n \simeq \eta \bm{F}_1^n = - \eta \omega \rho_{\rm f} \frac{S \Delta{x}}{N}\sum_{k=1}^{N}\frac{\bm{U}_k^n - \bm{u}^*(\bm{X}_k)}{{\Delta{t}}}. \label{eq:gsum2_2}
\end{equation}

