\includegraphics[width=16cm]{Figure1.pdf}
\caption{\label{fig1}(Color online) Workflow for predicting the glass transition temperature of polymers using molecular dynamics simulations and deep learning/machine learning, after which the predicted $T_g$ is used in the ECNLE theory to compute the structural relaxation time and diffusion coefficients.}
