\noindent\textbf{Baseline Methods}.
We select seven baseline methods: three officially used by SD, namely DwtDct \cite{old_wm-digital_wm_and_stega} and DwtDctSvd \cite{old_wm-digital_wm_and_stega}; two post-processing-based methods RivaGAN \cite{postprocessing_watermarking-RivaGAN} and EditGuard \cite{wm_and_tl-Editguard}, a fine tuning-based method called Stable Signature \cite{fine_tuning_based_watermarking-StableSignature}, a latent representation-based method called Tree-Ring \cite{latent_representation_based_watermarking-Treering}, and GS \cite{gaussianshading}.

