The proof of the final \cref{thm:ConesStrongQuantitative} is more explicit than that of the capillarity case (\cref{thm:capillarityStrongQuantitative}), in the sense that no compactness is used at that point and we can keep track rather explicitly of the dependence of the final constant in the quantitative inequality.


