In the small-group simulation, there are 9 UAVs among which four UAVs are receivers. Among the four receivers, one UAV is a mobile receiver. This mobile UAV receiver moves a distance of 102.6 meters at the speed of 10m/s during the multicasting. We vary the network traffic load from 512Kbit/s to 2.176Mbit/s to observe the AMD, AMT, and AMoT performance for the five schemes.
\begin{figure}[h]
