In the setting of \Cref{exa:Plug-inNormal},  \oldchange{uncertainty in the drift parameter could be incorporated by assuming that $\mu \sim \mathcal{N}(\hat{\mu}, \tau)$ for $\hat \tau \in \R_+$}. With entropy as the uncertainty measure, $U := \entr_{\lambda'}$ 
