\subsection{Overall Uncertainties}

Finally, a comprehensive test was conducted to evaluate the overall impact of updating the $Z\rightarrow \ell\ell$ background, including both its normalization and shape. For the normalization, the PDF used to calculate $R_{W/Z}$ was updated from {\sc MSTW2008 NNLO} to {\sc MSHT20 AN3LO}. For the shape, the default template generated at NLL+NLO accuracy with {\sc CTEQ6.1} was replaced by one generated at NNLL+NNLO accuracy using the {\sc NNPDF3.1 nnlo} PDF set. The combined impact of these updates on the extracted $W$ boson mass is summarized in Table \ref{tab:overall}.

