For each instruction $instruction_{\ell_{x_0,t}}$ of type (4) or (5) whose label $\ell_{x_0,t}$ belongs to the computation path $(\ell_{x_0,t}) _{t=1.. s}$ traversed by ${\cal M}$, the condition $cond_{\ell_{x_0,t}}$ has the form $r_{i_\ell}^{k_{i_\ell}}(Z_{j_{\ell,1}},\ldots, Z_{j_{\ell,k_{i_\ell}}})$ or $I_{j_\ell}=I_{k_\ell}$ for certain indices $i_\ell, j_\ell,k_\ell,j_{\ell,1},\ldots$ that depend on the label $\ell\in {\cal L}_{{\cal M},{\rm T}}\cup {\cal L}_{{\cal M},{\rm H}_{\rm T}}$ that satisfies $\ell_{x_0,t}=\ell$. 

