\vspace{0.2cm}

{\sf \hspace{0.4cm} $\textcolor{red}{\ell}:\, Z_j:= c_1^0; $

\hspace{0.3cm} $ \ell' : \, Z_{j+1}:={\nu}[{\cal O}](Z_j); $

\hspace{0.22cm} $ \ell'' : \,$ if $Z_j=Z_{j+1}$ then goto $\ell_1'$ else goto $\ell_2'; $

