 Let ${\cal A}$ be a structure in $ {\sf Struc}_{c_1,c_2}$ and $Q=\{c_1,c_2\}^\infty$ or $\,Q=\{c_1,c_2\}^2$. Moreover, let $\{c_1\}\in {\rm DEC}_{\cal A}$ or let both $\{c_1\}\in {\rm SDEC}_{\cal A}$ and $\{c_2\}\in {\rm SDEC}_{\cal A}$ hold. Then, there holds

\vspace{0.2cm}

\quad $({\rm SDEC}_{\cal A}^\nu)^Q={\rm SDEC}_{\cal A}^{\rm NDB}$.
\end{corollary}

