            Doping                & $n$-type/bottom & $p$-type/bottom  & $n$-type/upper & $p$-type/upper   & undoped        & $p$-type/bottom  \\
            $\gamma$              & $1.6~\pm$0.04   & $1.95~\pm$0.02   & $2.05~\pm$0.01 & $2.07~\pm$0.01   & $2.09~\pm$0.01 & $3.43~\pm$0.01      \\
            $\tau_{0}$            & 1250$~\pm$10~ns & 55$~\pm$4~ns     & 320$~\pm$10~ns & 340$~\pm$10~ns   & 370$~\pm$10~ns & 8$~\pm$1~ns    \\
